  "title": "Enrolling with Chariot for Electronic Grant Payments from the Saint Paul & Minnesota Foundation",
  "summary": "The Saint Paul & Minnesota Foundation is transitioning to Chariot Disbursements: Here’s what you need to know as a grantee. The Saint Paul & Minnesota Foundation is Minnesota's largest statewide community foundation, managing $1.9 billion in charitable assets and serving as the partner of choice for thousands of donors, nonprofits, and community organizations. In the coming weeks, they are transitioning their grant payments to be delivered through Chariot Disbursements.",
